OL,3,GNEWSACouncil agrees to move road at
OL,4,Arisk of collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has agreed an initial road
OL,7,Frealignment plan for a route at risk of
OL,8,Fcollapse due to coastal erosion.
OL,10,FCowbar Lane, the main road into the
OL,11,Fnorth side of the coastal village of
OL,12,FStaithes, was progressively eroding
OL,13,Ffrom waves and heavy rain, a council
OL,14,Freport previously found.
OL,16,FRedcar and Cleveland Council's cabinet
OL,17,Fagreed to the first phase of a scheme
OL,18,Fwhich involved moving Cowbar Lane away
OL,19,Ffrom the cliff edge and the demolition
OL,20,Fof a single property.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
