OL,3,GNEWSACouncil agrees to move road at
OL,4,Arisk of collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanners said its first phrase of
OL,7,Frealignment would deliver "15 years of
OL,8,Fsafe passage". A #1.8m budget was
OL,9,Fearmarked for the works, although the
OL,10,Fcouncil's report warned it could rise
OL,11,Fto #2.2m.
